    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2131$58 - 2019 cQ,s ui 13 jeks fikiqrdod - 2019'07'13No. 2131/58 - SATURDAY JULY 13, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MAHAWA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Mahawa Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the Independent Group, to which Andarawad Patabedige Abeyrathna Gunawardhanathe member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returnedmember if Independent Group who belongs to such Independent Group and is not disqualified under Section 9 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the aforesaid Independent Group has communicated his decision to nominateAthapaththu Konara Mudiyanselage Sujeewa Sampath Athapaththu to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, Returning Officer of the Mahawa Pradeshiya Sabha , actingin terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that AthapaththuKonara Mudiyanselage Sujeewa Sampath Athapaththu was selected as the member of the Mahawa Pradeshiya Sabha .\n\nGAMALATHGE DILIP NISHANTHA,Returning Officer,Mahawa Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kurunegala,12th July, 2019.\n\n07 - 973\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
