    "chunk_text": "12. Such Voluntary Agricultural Organization are permitted to work, either within, the Grama Niladhari Division,Agricultural Department\u2019s area of purview, Divisional Secretariat area or the area of purview of the office ofAssistant Director of Agriculture.\n\nRegistration\n\n1. Should apply for registration with a formal application form.\n\n3AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.2019\n\n3. A Voluntary Organization that registers for the first time should submit to the payment of a registration fee.\n\n4. The discretionary power to either register or to refuse to register a particular Voluntary Agriculture Organizationcould be exercised by the Director of Agriculture of the Southern Provincial Council or by an officer of theDepartment of Agriculture formally appointed by the Director of Agriculture of the Southern Provincial Council.\n\n5. Similarly, the Southern Province Agriculture Department has the power to subject a registered VoluntaryAgricultural Organization to either a period of observation or to a cancellation of the registration altogether, ifit is felt that the particular registered Voluntary Agricultural Organization is failing to achieve its expectedobjectives.\n\n6. For the purpose of registering as a Voluntary Agricultural Organization, an application form prepared in theformat of the following specimen application form should be submitted to the Extension office of the SouthernProvincial Department of Agriculture.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.20194A\n\nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE SOUTHERN PROVINCE\n\nApplication form for the Registration of Voluntary Agricultural Organization\n\n1. N