    "chunk_text": "The dates and the time of the inquiries;All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whichservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat 10.00 a.m. on the 22nd day of August, 2019 at MannarTown Divisional Secretariat.\n\nK. SIVASAMBU,Divisional Secretary,Mannar Town Division,\n\nMannar.\n\n12th July, 2019,Divisional Secretariat of Mannar Town.\n\n08 - 25\n\n5AIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'17PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.07.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: MN/DS/L/DI/AQ/WPP/36.Land Ministry No.: 4-3/2/2017/CEB/566.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No.28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/Servitude which is required fora public purpose:\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe lands allotment called Viyayadipannai in total extentof about 3.1999 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1 in PlanNo. MN 824 and prepared by Surveyor General situated inthe Village called Viyayadipannai, in the Grama NiladhariDivision No. 55 of Pesalai West, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Mannar Town of Mannar District in NorthernProvince.\n\nPlan No.: MN 824:\n\nLot No. 01Name of the Land: Viyayadipannai; Present use of theland: Bare land; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant:Not Known; Extent: 3.1999 Hectares.\n\nThe dates and the time of the inquiries;All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whichservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat 10.00 a.m. on the 22nd day of August, 2019 at MannarTown Divisional Secretariat."
