    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2133$35 - 2019 cQ,s ui 24 jeks nodod - 2019'07'24No. 2133/35 - WEDNESDAY JULY 24, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE UDUBADDAWAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Udubaddawa Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Not Attendingfor council meetings period of three months without permisson ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which AlpenerisgeHasini Sandathaka the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decideupon returned member if United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Thamma Hetti Mudalige Agnas Jasintha Peiris to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, Returning Officer of the Udubaddawa Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatThamma Hetti Mudalige Agnas Jasintha Peiris was selected as the member of the Udubaddawa Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nGAMALATHGE DILIP NISANTHA,Returning Officer,Udubaddawa Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kurunegala,23rd July, 2019.\n\n08 - 278\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
