    "chunk_text": "(b)address of the place of detention in which the search was conducted;\n\n(c)date, time and duration of the search;\n\n(d)names and any descriptive information of persons present at the place of detention at thetime of the search;\n\n(f)details of any photographs taken or vehicles searched under paragraphs (e) and (f) ofGuideline 5.\n\n9.An authorized specified officer of the OMP conducting a search of a place of detention shall, before such officerleaves such place of detention, issue a receipt acknowledging the retention of any object or document retainedduring such search, with a detailed description of objects or documents so retained.\n\n10.In these Guidelines, unless the context otherwise requires -\n\n\u201cAct\u201d means the Office on Missing Persons (Establishment, Administration and Discharge of Functions) Act,\n\nNo. 14 of 2016;\n\n\u201cdocument\u201d means any matter expressed or described upon any substance by means of letters, figures or marks\n\nor by more than one of those means, intended to be used or which may be used for the purpose ofrecording that matter and includes any matter that is expressed or described upon any substance byelectronic or digital form;\n\n\u201cobject\u201d means any movable tangible property;\n\n\u201cOMP\u201d means the Office on Missing Persons established by Section 3 of the Act;\n\n\u201cplace of detention\u201d includes any place of detention, police station, prison or any other place in which any person\n\nis suspected to be detained, or is suspected to have previously been detained in, whether by judicial orderor otherwise.\n\n08-313"
