    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'24PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.07.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nThe Allotments of below mentioned lands depicted in theAdvanced Tracing No. KA/ING/2018/271 dated of 23.11.2018prepared by the Surveyor-General situated in the Village ofBatugampala and Nimalagama in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Ingiriya in Kalutara District in the Western Province and boundedas follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Part \u2018A\u2019 of Nimalagama \u2013 Extent:0.0161 HectareNorth: Part \u2018A\u2019 of Nimalagama claimant cannot be found,Pradeshiya Sabha Road and Lot No. 2; East: Part \u2018A\u2019 of Nimalagamaclaimant cannot be found, Pradeshiya Sabha Road and Lot Nos. 2and 4; South: Lot Nos. 4 and 5; West: Lot Nos. 4 and 5, Canal andPart \u2018A\u2019 of Nimalagama claimant cannot be found.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2133$37 \u2013 2019 cQ,s 24 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'07'24No. 2133/37 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 24, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 30583 \u2013 36 (07/2019)\n\n02. Lot No. 2 \u2013 Extent: 0.0006 HectareNorth: Pradeshiya Sabha Road; East: Pradeshiya Sabha Road andPart \u2018A\u2019 of Nimalagama claimant cannot be found and Lot No. 3;South: Lot Nos. 3, 4 and 1; West: Lot Nos. 4 and 1."
