    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2133/45 - 2019 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.25\n\nNo. 2133/45 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 25, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 07\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms Reference\n\nNo. : 13/98/PC/200. Divisional Secretary Reference No.: BEN/2/7/3/15/II.\n\nTHE notice is hereby given under the Sub section (01) in the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act (Amended) No. 28 of 1964 as the Government intends to acquire the below mentioned land/Servitude for a public purpose.\n\nThe description of the land to be Acquired : The lots No. 01 & 02 called as Kuruntuwatta in two lands of the Preliminary Plan bearing No.: \u0d9c\u0dcf 4322 of the Surveyor General, located at the Induruwa village, within the Grama Niladhari Division 8 C - Athuruwella, of the Bentota Divisional Secretariat Division, in Galle District, Southern Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Kuruntuwatta; Details: Cemetery; Extent: 0.0791 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 02 Name of the land: Kuruntuwatta; Details: Cemetery; Extent: 0.1241 Hectare.\n\nThe all claimants and people who have ownership or other relation to the aforementioned land themselves or the people who are authorized by their documents should be appeared before me at 10.00 a.m. on 25th, September, 2019, at the Divisional Secretariat, Bentota.\n\nFurther, the nature of their ownership related to the mentioned land, details on the facts for claiming compensation regarding the acquiring that land, the amount of compensation and the way it is calculated shall be received to me by duly completed copies prior to the 18.09.2019.\n\nW. W. K. VITHANAGE, Divisional Secretary, Bentota.\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat, Bentota. 22nd of July, 2019. 08 - 353\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30591 - 25 (2019/07)"
