    "chunk_text": "Division of Mawathagama in Kurunagala District, North Western Province and bounded as follows: 1. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: Daisy Mount Estate; Name and the address of the Claimant: Mr. Pallewatte Gedara Ranjith, No. 15, Bettiyagoda, Kahapath Wila; Extent: About 0.0405 Hectare. Boundaries of the Land : North by : Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. KU/2418; East by : Road; South by : Daisy Mount Estate, claimed by A. G. N. Priyantha; West by : Land claimed by K. A. Pushpa Kanthi (Samagi Uyana). 2. Lot No. 2 Name of the land: Daisy Mount Estate; Name and the address of the Claimant: Mr. Horathal Pedige Sunil Wickramarathne, No. 13, Bettiyagoda, Kahapath Wila; Extent: About 0.0391 Hectare. Boundaries of the Land : North by : Lot No. 1 in Licensed Plan No. 2160; East by : Road; South by : Lot No. 02 in Preliminary Plan No.\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30607 - 27 (2019/07)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2019.07.26 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 26.07.2019\n\nKU 2418; West by : Land claimed by K. A. Pushpa Kanthi (Samagi Uyana)\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretary's office Mawathagama, on the 21st day of August, 2019 at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby request to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on before the 13th day of August, 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nland, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nE. A. S. EDIRISINGHE, Divisional Secretary and Acquisition Officer, Mawathagama, Kurunagala District.\n\nDivisional Secretary's Office, Mawathagama 20th July 2019. 08 - 433"
